                                                "sense_id": "a64795ab-9143-3127-b329-5a6603016c69",
                                                "text": "The Iewe of Tewkysbury which fell into a Gonge vpon the Satyrday."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e87c237-8060-463e-91b3-a9ca8d144c8c",
